# Alborada Foundation — environment variables
#
# No environment variables are currently required.
#
# The application is a static client-side build with no backend, no
# database, and no external API integrations. Nothing in src/ reads
# from the environment.
#
# Add variables here as they become necessary. Never commit real
# values — .env* is gitignored, with this example file as the only
# tracked exception.
